j/thumb/e/e8/6s4wiw7sfp2fsrsyorowhjx9x0rwxsv.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%AC%BC%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%B4%E6%A2%A6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e8/6s4wiw7sfp2fsrsyorowhjx9x0rwxsv.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%AC%BC%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%B4%E6%A2%A6.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e8/6s4wiw7sfp2fsrsyorowhjx9x0rwxsv.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />飞翅扰神•改贰\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）战斗回合开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">再动机会</font></span>]，可使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">振翅高飞</font></span>]，移动到<font color=\"#ed7950\">9</font>格内任意位置，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">8</font>点能量，并变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">浮空领域</font></span>]状态，技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">振翅高飞</span>]冷却<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">浮空领域</span>]状态下，被[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">单体远程</span>]以外技能攻击时，受到最终伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;